{"id":"01a0657e-133e-7de4-9f3c-af932ea9de58","chapterSlug":"rw5-41","paragraph":296,"wording":"[Berserker]","event":"used","holderSlug":"headscratcher","holderQuote":"Headscratcher stood up and realized he had blood all over him. The moth’s, not his. Numbtongue frowned.","effectQuote":"Headscratcher roared and gave into the rage. When the rage’s veil of mist cleared from his eyes he was standing over the dead moth. Someone—him—had ripped its head clean off."}
